_DFA \u2208 SPACE(n^2)\n\nProof: Write u b\u2192 v if there's a ladder from u to v of length \u2264 b.\nHere's a recursive procedure to solve the bounded DFA ladder problem:"]}, "id": "LHnmwSVgJe", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 30.76923076923077, "width": 69.70673076923077, "height": 43.9160839160839, "rotation": 0}, "id": "Nfb3k9LWbS", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image", "type": "rectangle", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 30.76923076923077, "width": 69.70673076923077, "height": 43.9160839160839, "rotation": 0, "labels": ["equation"]}, "id": "Nfb3k9LWbS", "from_name": "label", "to_name": "image", "type": "labels", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 2.5034965034965038, "y": 30.76923076923077, "width": 69.70673076923077, "height": 43.9160839160839, "rotation": 0, "text": ["BOUNDED-LADDER_DFA = {(B, u, v, b) | B a DFA and u b\u2192 v by a ladder in L(B)}\n\nB-L = \"On input (B, u, v, b) Let m = |u| = |v|.\n1. For b = 1, accept if u, v \u2208 L(B) and differ in \u2264 1 place, else reject.\n2. For b > 1, repeat for each w \u2208 L(B) of length |u|\n3. Recursively test u b/2\u2192 w and w b/2\u2192 v [division rounds up]\n4. Accept both accept.\n5. Reject [if all fail].\"\n\nTest (B, u, v) \u2208 LADDER_DFA with B-L procedure on input (B, u, v, t) for t = |\u03a3|^m"]}, "id": "Nfb3k9LWbS", "from_name": "transcription", "to_name": "image", "type": "textarea", "origin": "manual"}, {"original_width": 640, "original_height": 358, "image_rotation": 0, "value": {"x": 72.05375874125875, "y": 38.46153846153847, "width": 26.13024475524476, "height": 38.6013986013986, "rotation": 0}, "id": "F3f8sX09HW", "from_name": "bbox", "to_name": "image",